1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 24=

10
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:10,630
Border defense.

11
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:14,540
Disaster relief.

12
00:01:21,430 --> 00:01:22,270
Military pay.

13
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:26,830
So many lives

14
00:01:27,110 --> 00:01:31,540
depend on my finest medicinal herbs.

15
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:37,470
This stench of decay

16
00:01:38,750 --> 00:01:40,540
is the truest scent

17
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:43,030
in this world.

18
00:01:56,470 --> 00:01:57,030
Who's there?

19
00:01:57,180 --> 00:01:57,860
Mr. Wang.

20
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:00,070
I've come at the request
of an old acquaintance

21
00:02:00,180 --> 00:02:00,870
to pay you a visit.

22
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,230
What acquaintance?

23
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:03,700
I don't know anyone.

24
00:02:03,950 --> 00:02:04,420
Leave now.

25
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:05,810
Sir.

26
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:07,980
I serve the imperial court.

27
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:10,140
If you're willing
to testify against Liu Xian,

28
00:02:10,510 --> 00:02:12,030
I can guarantee your safety.

29
00:02:12,230 --> 00:02:13,780
Liu Xian mixed sand
into medicinal herbs,

30
00:02:13,830 --> 00:02:14,950
falsified reported losses,

31
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:16,260
and evaded taxes.

32
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:19,870
His dealings with the government granary
are even more appalling.

33
00:02:20,830 --> 00:02:21,620
These accounts

34
00:02:21,780 --> 00:02:23,310
were all kept by you, weren't they?

35
00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:27,340
I knew

36
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:29,900
this day would come sooner or later.

37
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:31,780
As long as you're
willing to tell the truth,

38
00:02:32,310 --> 00:02:33,830
the imperial court
will see justice done.

39
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:43,510
You...

40
00:02:44,980 --> 00:02:46,110
Do you truly mean that?

41
00:03:04,110 --> 00:03:04,700
There's no saving him.

42
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:07,390
Our key witness has been silenced.

43
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:09,190
At this point,

44
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:11,950
we have no choice but to take the risk.

45
00:03:12,380 --> 00:03:16,060
(Jiangnan Fuyi Government Granary)

46
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:39,260
It's all sand.

47
00:03:41,070 --> 00:03:42,580
They even used rotten scraps
to make up the stock.

48
00:03:43,540 --> 00:03:44,670
This is a government granary,

49
00:03:45,540 --> 00:03:46,860
yet the corruption runs this deep.

50
00:03:47,950 --> 00:03:49,190
That wretched merchant.

51
00:04:13,230 --> 00:04:15,510
(Liu's Apothecary)
You dare investigate my accounts?

52
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:18,420
You should have found out first

53
00:04:18,670 --> 00:04:20,260
who controls Jiangnan Circuit.

54
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:21,580
I...

55
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:26,070
Liu Xian.

56
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:28,070
Would you rather be executed here

57
00:04:28,070 --> 00:04:29,230
or be handed over to the authorities?

58
00:04:29,580 --> 00:04:30,740
The choice is yours.

59
00:04:33,350 --> 00:04:35,260
Executed here?

60
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:39,070
Taken into custody?

61
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:40,950
Cut them down!

62
00:04:41,260 --> 00:04:41,910
- Yes!
- Yes!

63
00:04:58,230 --> 00:04:59,020
Trying to run?

64
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:05,980
Boss Liu.

65
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:08,580
Would you rather be executed here

66
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:10,980
or be handed over to the authorities?

67
00:05:13,340 --> 00:05:14,630
Hand me over to the authorities.

68
00:05:15,390 --> 00:05:16,390
I confess.

69
00:05:16,870 --> 00:05:17,870
I'm guilty.

70
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:20,220
The corrupt merchant Liu Xian

71
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:22,700
colluded with officials
and tax officers of Jiangnan Circuit.

72
00:05:23,390 --> 00:05:24,550
The evidence is conclusive.

73
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:27,100
What a parasite upon Jiangnan.

74
00:05:27,780 --> 00:05:29,070
Liu Xian is guilty of three crimes.

75
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:30,460
First,

76
00:05:30,900 --> 00:05:34,340
he filled government granaries
with sand and inferior medicines,

77
00:05:34,830 --> 00:05:36,750
leaving our soldiers at the frontier
without proper medicine.

78
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,510
He showed
utter disregard for human life.

79
00:05:38,900 --> 00:05:39,550
Second,

80
00:05:39,830 --> 00:05:40,870
he embezzled military supplies

81
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,070
and evaded imperial taxes.

82
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:44,580
The staggering amount
involved is beyond belief.

83
00:05:45,020 --> 00:05:46,220
Such crimes undermine
the very foundation of the realm

84
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:47,760
and warrant death.

85
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:48,700
Third,

86
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:50,190
he burned the account books
to destroy evidence,

87
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,390
showing complete contempt for the law

88
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:54,830
and outrageous audacity.

89
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:56,020
Fourth,

90
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:58,340
he attempted to murder
an imperial official.

91
00:05:59,630 --> 00:06:00,700
For these four crimes combined,

92
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:01,900
there can be no pardon.

93
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:04,070
Take him to
the execution grounds immediately

94
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:05,990
and carry out
his sentence according to law.

95
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:08,390
All those who colluded with him

96
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:09,900
shall be severely
punished according to law.

97
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,220
No one will be spared.

98
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:14,990
- Your Majesty is wise!
- Your Majesty is wise!

99
00:06:30,460 --> 00:06:31,460
Liu Xian has been brought to justice.

100
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:33,510
Li.

101
00:06:33,790 --> 00:06:35,960
♪You are the moment
when the sudden rain clears♪

102
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:38,020
You did very well.

103
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:40,630
What did I do well?

104
00:06:41,580 --> 00:06:42,510
You heal the sick and save lives,

105
00:06:43,100 --> 00:06:44,100
protect His Majesty,

106
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:45,660
and care for all under Heaven.

107
00:06:47,810 --> 00:06:51,040
♪When the wind rises,
words linger unspoken♪

108
00:06:51,950 --> 00:06:53,100
You protect this realm,

109
00:06:54,990 --> 00:06:55,870
and I'll protect you.

110
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:58,020
It's a promise.

111
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:01,750
All right.

112
00:07:01,750 --> 00:07:07,760
♪Once it enters the heart,
it becomes the gentlest shackle♪

113
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,000
Baby, smile.

114
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:14,240
♪Longing is a vine that climbs
the moonlight and grows into a tree♪

115
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:16,140
Yanzhi, look. The baby is smiling.

116
00:07:16,140 --> 00:07:19,170
♪Carve your name away,
and its traces only grow clearer♪

117
00:07:19,170 --> 00:07:23,410
♪The more I struggle, the more
crimson marks bloom across my palms♪

118
00:07:23,610 --> 00:07:29,000
♪Once it enters the heart, it becomes
a poison that tears through the soul♪

119
00:07:30,210 --> 00:07:34,120
♪The one who drinks the poison smiles,
savoring every drop as it courses within♪

120
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:35,950
May the realm know peace and prosperity,

121
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:36,950
and the people
live in peace and security.

122
00:07:36,950 --> 00:07:40,180
♪If longing is a game,
I willingly become♪

123
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:44,970
♪Your most lingering move,
a trap I can never escape♪

124
00:07:59,250 --> 00:07:59,900
Sister.

125
00:08:03,950 --> 00:08:04,830
Mother.

126
00:08:06,020 --> 00:08:06,900
Mother.

127
00:08:09,020 --> 00:08:09,900
Mother.

128
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:13,750
You are running so fast.

129
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:15,070
Aren't you afraid you'll fall?

130
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:16,510
No.

131
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:18,990
Mother said

132
00:08:19,780 --> 00:08:21,550
if I fall, I should get back up.

133
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:23,750
What else did Mother say?

134
00:08:24,070 --> 00:08:25,190
Do you still remember, Xiao Qi?

135
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,820
Mother said

136
00:08:27,310 --> 00:08:28,700
Father was a great general

137
00:08:29,210 --> 00:08:30,190
who defended our home and country.

138
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:33,750
When I grow up,
I want to be a great general too

139
00:08:34,070 --> 00:08:35,140
and protect Mother.

140
00:08:36,260 --> 00:08:39,190
Do you even know
what a great general is?

141
00:08:43,550 --> 00:08:43,900
All right.

142
00:08:44,260 --> 00:08:44,900
Go play.

143
00:08:49,700 --> 00:08:51,100
(In this mortal world,)

144
00:08:51,950 --> 00:08:53,630
(regrets are inevitable,)

145
00:08:55,220 --> 00:08:56,190
(yet in the end,)

146
00:08:57,310 --> 00:08:58,220
(it is all worthwhile.)

147
00:08:59,170 --> 00:09:03,460
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

148
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:11,400
♪Between black and white, once the piece
is placed, there are no regrets♪

149
00:09:11,710 --> 00:09:13,050
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

150
00:09:13,050 --> 00:09:14,960
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

151
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:18,780
- Long live the Emperor!
- Long live the Emperor!

152
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:22,950
- Long live the Emperor!
- Long live the Emperor!

153
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:25,070
Let go of me!

154
00:09:25,070 --> 00:09:25,340
Come on.

155
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:25,990
I'm not going back with you!

156
00:09:26,070 --> 00:09:26,430
Come on!

157
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:27,550
Come with me!

158
00:09:28,190 --> 00:09:29,220
Stop making a spectacle of yourself!

159
00:09:29,310 --> 00:09:30,430
Come home with me and get married!

160
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:31,340
I don't want to get married!

161
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:32,270
I want to study!

162
00:09:32,910 --> 00:09:33,580
What nonsense.

163
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:34,620
What does a woman need an education for?

164
00:09:34,790 --> 00:09:35,910
A good marriage is what truly matters.

165
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:36,620
Come on.

166
00:09:38,030 --> 00:09:39,150
Women aren't allowed to study.

167
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,500
Who says women aren't allowed to study?

168
00:09:41,430 --> 00:09:42,070
What nonsense!

169
00:09:42,310 --> 00:09:43,380
Everyone, listen!

170
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:45,550
Why shouldn't women be allowed to study,

171
00:09:46,030 --> 00:09:47,310
or inherit family property,

172
00:09:47,830 --> 00:09:49,580
when even their lives are decided
by their fathers, brothers, and husbands?

173
00:09:49,580 --> 00:09:50,460
How is that fair?

174
00:09:51,100 --> 00:09:52,380
Our dynasty has already set a precedent.

175
00:09:52,380 --> 00:09:53,910
Women can also
serve as officials at court.

176
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:55,460
We women are no less capable than men,

177
00:09:56,430 --> 00:09:59,620
just as men can manage a household.

178
00:10:02,380 --> 00:10:03,380
All of you have mothers,

179
00:10:04,030 --> 00:10:04,910
and you may have daughters of your own.

180
00:10:05,830 --> 00:10:07,030
Would you want to see your own daughters

181
00:10:07,070 --> 00:10:08,270
born only to live
at the mercy of others?

182
00:10:08,340 --> 00:10:09,620
Of course not.

183
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,220
No.

184
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:11,980
If women could also study
and take the imperial examinations,

185
00:10:12,190 --> 00:10:13,070
manage their households
and build careers,

186
00:10:13,620 --> 00:10:15,310
wouldn't our families
and our realm prosper even more?

187
00:10:16,460 --> 00:10:17,220
We women

188
00:10:17,670 --> 00:10:19,030
need not depend on men.

189
00:10:19,220 --> 00:10:20,910
We can build lives of our own.

190
00:10:22,310 --> 00:10:23,270
All we ask for

191
00:10:24,430 --> 00:10:25,430
is equality between women

192
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:27,150
and men.

193
00:10:28,410 --> 00:10:30,150
Such courage and conviction.

194
00:10:30,670 --> 00:10:31,860
As expected of a student

195
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:33,100
personally taught by my wife.

196
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:35,580
Every word she said is true.

197
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,580
Our dynasty should have established
laws protecting women long ago.

198
00:10:39,830 --> 00:10:41,100
Women should be allowed to attend school

199
00:10:41,310 --> 00:10:42,340
and inherit family property.

200
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:44,910
Marriage must be entered
into willingly by both parties.

201
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:47,910
And one more thing.

202
00:10:50,220 --> 00:10:52,310
Women should also have the right
to divorce their husbands.

203
00:10:55,150 --> 00:10:56,190
Everything my wife said

204
00:10:57,100 --> 00:10:58,670
is in keeping with the natural order
and human decency.

205
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:30,580
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

206
00:11:31,340 --> 00:11:34,280
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

207
00:11:34,940 --> 00:11:37,760
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

208
00:11:38,610 --> 00:11:41,600
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

209
00:11:42,450 --> 00:11:45,770
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

210
00:11:46,110 --> 00:11:49,400
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

211
00:11:49,750 --> 00:11:56,230
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

212
00:11:57,020 --> 00:12:04,110
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

213
00:12:06,610 --> 00:12:14,460
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

214
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,570
♪I stand here today♪

215
00:12:16,710 --> 00:12:21,220
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

216
00:12:21,220 --> 00:12:28,710
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

217
00:12:29,350 --> 00:12:30,640
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

218
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:33,040
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

219
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:40,330
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
